msgctxt "64"
msgid "Get away from me, you pervert!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"You've gotta be kidding me, Natsumi! I gave up everything for you! My "
"business, my life, everything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Hey, she told you to leave her alone! You got a problem, you can take it up "
"with me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "I drop 20 mil on your ass and this is what I get...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"You're talkin' about cash you spent at the club, yeah? Then that's between "
"you and the club. Now get the hell outta her face!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Akiho-san... Sorry 'bout all that. No surprise that you've got creeps "
"waiting for you down every street, though, especially here. Maybe you're "
"just not cut out for the big city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"How about you come back to Okinawa with me? Start fresh. Me and the rest of "
"the Ryudo Family'll make sure nobody dares to even look at you the wrong "
"way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Well thank you, but... I'll think about it. Anyway, I should be going. "
"Hopefully our next meeting isn't under such awful circumstances."
msgstr ""

